# Keepance sidecar binaries
#
# This folder holds platform-specific compiled sidecars that get bundled
# into the installer via `tauri.conf.json:bundle.externalBin`.
#
# Phase 2 reserves the directory but doesn't populate it yet — the release
# pipeline builds `keepance-mcp-<target>` per platform and stages the files
# here before `tauri build`.
#
# Phase 4 adds:
#   - keepance-mcp-<target>    (M4: MCP server)
#   - parakeet-transcribe-<target>  (M6: voice input)
